{
  "info": {
    "name": "telegram-rest-gateway",
    "description": "REST API self-hosted гейтвея к пользовательскому Telegram-аккаунту (TDLib + Drogon).\n\nНастрой переменные окружения: baseUrl, token (Bearer), и по мере работы chatId/messageId/fileId/userId.\nВсе 64-битные id — строки. Auth: Bearer на всех /v1/**, кроме health/ready/metrics/ui.\nСкоупы токена: read (GET+WS), write (мутации), admin (/v1/auth/*, session export).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "chatId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "messageId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "fileId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "telegram",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "inviteLink",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "System",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Живость процесса.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ready",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/ready",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "ready"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Готовность (авторизован в Telegram).",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics (Prometheus)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/metrics",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "metrics"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Prometheus text exposition.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "State",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/state",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "state"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Состояние конечного автомата авторизации."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Session init",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/session",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "session"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Идемпотентная инициализация."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Phone",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/phone",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "phone"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Отправить номер → Telegram присылает код (для кастомного api_id часто НЕ доходит — используй QR).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"+79001234567\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "QR login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/qr",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "qr"
              ]
            },
            "description": "QR-логин: в state появится qr_link (tg://login), сканируй с телефона."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Code",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/code",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "code"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Код подтверждения. → ready или wait_password (2FA).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"12345\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Code resend",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/code/resend",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "code",
                "resend"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Повторно запросить код."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Password (2FA)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Облачный пароль → ready.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"password\": \"секрет\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Session export",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/session/export",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "session",
                "export"
              ]
            },
            "description": "base64 td.binlog для stateless-запуска (TGW_SESSION). СЕКРЕТ = доступ к аккаунту. Требует admin-скоуп."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Account",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Инфо об аккаунте."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "User card",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{userId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Карточка пользователя."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Contacts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/contacts",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "contacts"
              ]
            },
            "description": "id контактов."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chats",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats?limit=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "offset",
                  "value": "0",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Список чатов. offset — пагинация; meta.next_offset для след. страницы."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Chat card",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Карточка чата (тип, название)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Resolve @username",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/resolve?username={{username}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "resolve"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{username}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Публичный чат/юзер по @username → chat_id."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Join by invite link",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/join",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "join"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Вступить по invite-ссылке.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"invite_link\": \"{{inviteLink}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Members",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/members?",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "members"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "query",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Участники чата (по правам Telegram)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Messages",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "History",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?limit=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "from_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "История, от новых к старым. from_id — курсор (meta.next_cursor). Медиа несут file_id."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send text",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "disabled": true
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Отправка текста → 202 + temporary_message_id (финал по WS). Опц. parse_mode (markdown/html), reply_to_message_id, заголовок Idempotency-Key.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"Привет из Postman\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send markdown reply",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages"
              ]
            },
            "description": "MarkdownV2: спецсимволы вне разметки экранировать.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"*bold* \\\\_esc\\\\_\",\n  \"parse_mode\": \"markdown\",\n  \"reply_to_message_id\": \"{{messageId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Edit",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/{{messageId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages",
                "{{messageId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Правка текста своего сообщения.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"отредактировано\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Удаление. revoke=true — у всех.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message_ids\": [\n    \"{{messageId}}\"\n  ],\n  \"revoke\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark read",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/read",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages",
                "read"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Отметить прочитанными.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message_ids\": [\n    \"{{messageId}}\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Forward",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/forward",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages",
                "forward"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Переслать в текущий чат из from_chat_id.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"from_chat_id\": \"{{chatId}}\",\n  \"message_ids\": [\n    \"{{messageId}}\"\n  ],\n  \"send_copy\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Files",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload (binary)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/octet-stream"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "file",
              "file": {
                "src": "/path/to/file.jpg"
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/files?type=photo&file_name=file.jpg",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "files"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "photo"
                },
                {
                  "key": "file_name",
                  "value": "file.jpg"
                },
                {
                  "key": "caption",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Сырое тело octet-stream. type=document|photo|video|voice|audio. → 202, финал по WS. Укажи файл во вкладке Body → binary."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Download / status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Range",
                "value": "bytes=0-1023",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/files/{{fileId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "files",
                "{{fileId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Докачано → стрим байтов (200; поддержка Range→206). Иначе → 202 + прогресс, готовность по updateFile в WS."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reactions",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Set reaction",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/{{messageId}}/reactions",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages",
                "{{messageId}}",
                "reactions"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Поставить emoji-реакцию.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"emoji\": \"👍\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove reaction",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/{{messageId}}/reactions",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chats",
                "{{chatId}}",
                "messages",
                "{{messageId}}",
                "reactions"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Снять реакцию.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"emoji\": \"👍\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "WebSocket /v1/updates",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Updates stream (info)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/updates",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "updates"
              ]
            },
            "description": "WebSocket-поток апдейтов. В Postman создай отдельный WebSocket Request к ws(s)://<host>/v1/updates с заголовком Authorization: Bearer <token> (или Sec-WebSocket-Protocol: bearer.<token>). После connect сервер шлёт hello, далее фреймы update. Фильтр: отправь {\"type\":\"subscribe\",\"update_types\":[...]}. Это HTTP-заглушка только для документации — обычным Send не сработает."
